RH Garden
Copyright 2026 Future Technologies Laboratory LLC

RH Garden is a research and formal-verification project investigating
representation-based approaches to the Riemann Hypothesis.

The mathematical architecture, research direction, formalization choices,
software integration, and resulting work were developed by Future
Technologies Laboratory LLC with AI-assisted research and software
development using OpenAI ChatGPT and Codex.

RH Garden depends on, but does not vendor, the Apache-2.0 Zeta23
formalization authored by Anthropic PBC:
https://github.com/anthropics/zeta-23-lean, pinned at commit
2bafb8c88f177284a2123b5fefa2ff84e2365eb6.
